// The project's base configuration, tracked so a fresh checkout can generate.
//
// Local signing identity is not written here. `just ios local-signing` writes
// the `LOCAL_*` settings into `Local.xcconfig`, which is gitignored; the
// optional include below picks it up when it exists and is silently skipped
// when it does not. Every `LOCAL_*` setting in project.yml carries the
// shipping value as its `$(VAR:default=…)`, so a checkout with no local
// signing builds exactly as a release does.
//
// This indirection is the point: pointing `configFiles` straight at the
// gitignored file made every clone — CI included — fail xcodegen's spec
// validation with "Invalid config file", because the file is not there.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
